{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-checkout","title":"稀疏检出与部分克隆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/sparse-checkout","wordCount":806,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀疏检出与部分克隆\">稀疏检出与部分克隆</h1><h2 id=\"大仓库的挑战\">大仓库的挑战</h2><p>当 Git 仓库包含数十万文件或数 GB 历史时，常规的 <code>git clone</code> 会耗时数分钟甚至更久。开发者通常只需要仓库的一小部分，完整克隆是对时间和磁盘的浪费。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>克隆时间长</td>\n<td>下载完整历史和所有文件</td>\n<td>partial-clone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘占用大</td>\n<td>包含不需要的历史和文件</td>\n<td>shallow clone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>checkout 慢</td>\n<td>写入大量不需要的文件</td>\n<td>sparse-checkout</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[大仓库问题] --&gt; B[Shallow Clone]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Partial Clone]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Sparse Checkout]&#10;    B --&gt; E[减少历史深度]&#10;    C --&gt; F[按需下载对象]&#10;    D --&gt; G[只检出需要的目录]\">graph TD\n    A[大仓库问题] --&gt; B[Shallow Clone]\n    A --&gt; C[Partial Clone]\n    A --&gt; D[Sparse Checkout]\n    B --&gt; E[减少历史深度]\n    C --&gt; F[按需下载对象]\n    D --&gt; G[只检出需要的目录]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>面对大仓库，三种技术分别从&quot;历史深度、对象下载、工作区范围&quot;三个方向减少数据量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>浅克隆</td>\n<td>只下载指定深度的历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分克隆</td>\n<td>按需下载对象，可用 filter 跳过 blob</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏检出</td>\n<td>只把指定的目录检出到工作区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cone 模式</td>\n<td>稀疏检出的推荐模式，按目录匹配更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按需获取</td>\n<td>缺失对象在使用时再从远端拉取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protocol v2</td>\n<td>服务端支持部分克隆的前提</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"shallow-clone-浅克隆\">Shallow Clone 浅克隆</h2><p><strong>浅克隆（Shallow Clone）</strong> 只下载指定深度的提交历史：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/org/large-repo.git&#10;&#10;git clone --depth 10 https://github.com/org/large-repo.git&#10;&#10;git clone --shallow-since=&quot;2025-01-01&quot; https://github.com/org/repo.git&#10;&#10;git clone --single-branch --branch main --depth 1 https://github.com/org/repo.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/large-repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/large-repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shallow-since=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --single-branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --branch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span></code></pre></div><p>浅克隆的限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>是否支持</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查看最近历史</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>在 depth 范围内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建分支</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>正常工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整 git log</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>只有 depth 范围内的历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git blame</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>可能不完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git bisect</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>范围受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git fetch --unshallow&#10;&#10;git fetch --deepen=50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --unshallow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --deepen=50</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 浅克隆最适合 CI/CD 场景——只需要最新代码进行构建和测试，无需完整历史。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"partial-clone-部分克隆\">Partial Clone 部分克隆</h2><p><strong>部分克隆（Partial Clone）</strong> 允许按需下载 Git 对象，初始克隆时跳过大文件或 blob：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/org/repo.git&#10;&#10;git clone --filter=blob:limit=1m https://github.com/org/repo.git&#10;&#10;git clone --filter=tree:0 https://github.com/org/repo.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:limit=1m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=tree:0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤器</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>blob:none</code></td>\n<td>不下载任何 blob，按需获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>blob:limit=&lt;size&gt;</code></td>\n<td>不下载超过指定大小的 blob</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tree:0</code></td>\n<td>不下载 tree 对象，按需获取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[git clone --filter=blob:none] --&gt; B[下载 commit + tree]&#10;    B --&gt; C[checkout 时按需下载 blob]&#10;    C --&gt; D[git blame 时按需下载历史 blob]\">graph LR\n    A[git clone --filter=blob:none] --&gt; B[下载 commit + tree]\n    B --&gt; C[checkout 时按需下载 blob]\n    C --&gt; D[git blame 时按需下载历史 blob]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rev-list --filter=blob:none --all --objects | wc -l\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rev-list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --objects</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"sparse-checkout-稀疏检出\">Sparse Checkout 稀疏检出</h2><p><strong>稀疏检出（Sparse Checkout）</strong> 只将仓库中指定的目录/文件检出到工作目录，其余文件不会出现在磁盘上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/org/monorepo.git&#10;cd monorepo&#10;git sparse-checkout init --cone&#10;git sparse-checkout set apps/my-app libs/shared&#10;git checkout main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/my-app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libs/shared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git sparse-checkout list&#10;&#10;git sparse-checkout add docs/&#10;&#10;git sparse-checkout disable\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disable</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sparse-checkout init</code></td>\n<td>初始化稀疏检出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--cone</code></td>\n<td>使用 cone 模式（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sparse-checkout set</code></td>\n<td>设置检出目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sparse-checkout add</code></td>\n<td>添加检出目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sparse-checkout list</code></td>\n<td>列出当前检出目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sparse-checkout disable</code></td>\n<td>禁用稀疏检出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[大仓库根目录] --&gt; A[apps/]&#10;    R --&gt; B[libs/]&#10;    R --&gt; C[docs/]&#10;    R --&gt; D[tools/]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[&quot;apps/my-app/ ✅ 检出&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[&quot;apps/other/ ❌ 跳过&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;libs/shared/ ✅ 检出&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;libs/legacy/ ❌ 跳过&quot;]\">graph TD\n    R[大仓库根目录] --&gt; A[apps/]\n    R --&gt; B[libs/]\n    R --&gt; C[docs/]\n    R --&gt; D[tools/]\n    A --&gt; A1[\"apps/my-app/ ✅ 检出\"]\n    A --&gt; A2[\"apps/other/ ❌ 跳过\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"libs/shared/ ✅ 检出\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"libs/legacy/ ❌ 跳过\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>--cone</code> 模式比传统的模式文件匹配更快，推荐始终使用 cone 模式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合使用\">组合使用</h2><p>三种技术可以组合使用，实现最优的性能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clone \\&#10;  --filter=blob:none \\&#10;  --sparse \\&#10;  https://github.com/org/huge-monorepo.git&#10;&#10;cd huge-monorepo&#10;git sparse-checkout set apps/my-app libs/core\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --sparse</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://github.com/org/huge-monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> huge-monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/my-app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libs/core</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合方案</th>\n<th>初始下载量</th>\n<th>磁盘占用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>shallow + sparse</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>CI/CD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partial + sparse</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>日常开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partial only</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>需要完整目录结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整克隆</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>需要完整历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI/CD 最优方案&#10;git clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none --sparse \\&#10;  https://github.com/org/monorepo.git&#10;cd monorepo&#10;git sparse-checkout set apps/target-app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI/CD 最优方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sparse</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/target-app</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务端配置\">服务端配置</h2><p>部分克隆需要服务端支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>支持情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>✅ 完全支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitLab</td>\n<td>✅ 完全支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bitbucket</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gitea</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自建 Git</td>\n<td>需要配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global protocol.version 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> protocol.version</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((稀疏检出与部分克隆))&#10;    Shallow Clone&#10;      --depth N&#10;      CI/CD 首选&#10;      可 unshallow&#10;    Partial Clone&#10;      --filter=blob:none&#10;      按需下载&#10;      需服务端支持&#10;    Sparse Checkout&#10;      只检出目录子集&#10;      --cone 模式&#10;      Monorepo 利器&#10;    组合方案&#10;      shallow + sparse&#10;      partial + sparse&#10;      按场景选择\">mindmap\n  root((稀疏检出与部分克隆))\n    Shallow Clone\n      --depth N\n      CI/CD 首选\n      可 unshallow\n    Partial Clone\n      --filter=blob:none\n      按需下载\n      需服务端支持\n    Sparse Checkout\n      只检出目录子集\n      --cone 模式\n      Monorepo 利器\n    组合方案\n      shallow + sparse\n      partial + sparse\n      按场景选择</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Shallow Clone</strong> 限制历史深度，适合只需最新代码的 CI/CD 场景</li>\n<li><strong>Partial Clone</strong> 按需下载 Git 对象，首次克隆快但后续操作可能触发网络请求</li>\n<li><strong>Sparse Checkout</strong> 只检出需要的目录，是 Monorepo 开发的利器</li>\n<li>三种技术可以<strong>组合使用</strong>实现最优性能：<code>--filter=blob:none --sparse</code> 是日常开发推荐方案</li>\n<li>使用前确认服务端支持 <strong>Git Protocol v2</strong> 和部分克隆过滤器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稀疏检出与部分克隆","id":"稀疏检出与部分克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"大仓库的挑战","id":"大仓库的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Shallow Clone 浅克隆","id":"shallow-clone-浅克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"Partial Clone 部分克隆","id":"partial-clone-部分克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"Sparse Checkout 稀疏检出","id":"sparse-checkout-稀疏检出"},{"level":2,"text":"组合使用","id":"组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端配置","id":"服务端配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"子模块与子树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/submodules-and-subtrees"},"next":{"title":"Git Hooks 钩子机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/git-hooks"}}